OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 24 FEB
OL,4,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,5,     GGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,6,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,7,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,8,     Gwith familiar favourites.
OL,9,G1300FClassical Live
OL,10,     GFiona Talkington introduces an
OL,11,     Gafternoon of specially made
OL,12,     Grecordings including Berlioz's
OL,13,     GHarold in Italy symphony and
OL,14,     Grecent studio recordings by Radio
OL,15,     G3's New Generaton Artists.
OL,16,G1600FComposer of the Week: Amy Beach
OL,17,     GDonald explores the story behind
OL,18,     Gthe 'first Symphony by an
OL,19,     GAmerican woman' - Amy Beach's
OL,20,     G'Gaelic' Symphony of 1897.
